OL,4,CRare turtles found inside baggage at   
OL,5,CAmsterdam airport                      
OL,6,GTwenty-six "very rare" turtles have    
OL,7,Gbeen seized from a traveller's checked 
OL,8,Gbaggage at Amsterdam's Schiphol        
OL,9,Gairport, a Dutch government agency has 
OL,10,Gsaid.                                  
OL,12,FThe Netherlands Food and Consumer      
OL,13,FProduct Safety Authority (NVWA) said a 
OL,14,Fman flying from Mexico to Hong Kong    
OL,15,Fvia the airport was arrested on        
OL,16,FSaturday after the Vallarta mud        
OL,17,Fturtles were found by customs officers.
